plat-windows-x64-sub = 多數電腦：64 位元 Intel 或 AMD
plat-windows-arm64 = Windows on ARM
plat-windows-arm64-sub = Snapdragon 筆電等
plat-mac-arm64 = macOS
plat-mac-arm64-sub = Apple 晶片：M1 及之後
